    "reviews": "\u201cWe\u2019re talking about the peanut butter and jelly of gameplay and music here.\u201d<br>9.5/10 \u2013 NintendoWorldReport<br><br>\u201cThere\u2019s such a range of styles and genres throughout, and all of it is amazing.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 RPG Fan<br><br>\u201cIt hits all those baffling narrative beats and digs deep into your soul until the only goal is to see it out to the end.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Checkpoint Gaming<br>",
